# Browser
# The sneaked permanent attacks what the returned creature was attacking (CR 702.190b), a planeswalker as well as a player.
# Bot1 attacks with two creatures, Ornithopter at Bot2 and Healer's Hawk at Bot2's Liliana of the Veil (loyalty 3), and
# returns the Hawk to cast Leonardo for his sneak cost {W}. Leonardo enters tapped and attacking Liliana, not Bot2 and not
# what the other attacker attacks: his 1 lifelink damage takes Liliana to 2 and gains Bot1 1 life (damage to a planeswalker
# is damage, CR 702.15b), which puts a +1/+1 counter on him; the Ornithopter (0/2) deals none, so Bot2 stays at 20.
# In the browser, Leonardo's menu in the hand names the sneak cast with its cost, and once he resolves the page stands him
# in the combat group attacking Liliana, apart from the Ornithopter's at Bot2.

